 "remarks": "Highest and Best Due Monday 9/21/26 at 5 PM EST. Side-by-side two-family with value-add potential in the Byram neighborhood of Greenwich. The property features two mirror-image units, each with 2 bedrooms, 1.5 baths, private laundry, its own garage, storage, and outdoor deck. The side-by-side layout offers a single-family feel with no neighbors above or below. Currently occupied by great tenants, with the option to be delivered vacant, giving the next owner flexibility to renovate and reset rents, live in one side and rent the other, or reposition as an investment. Projected market rents of approximately $3,000/month per unit. Additional FAR may be available, subject to zoning requirements and approvals.",
